OL,3,GNEWSASeven more arrets over Celtic
OL,4,Atitle party disorder - bringing total
OL,5,Ato 50
OL,6,
OL,7,FSeven more people have been arrested
OL,8,Fand charged over disorder during fan
OL,9,Fcelebrations after Celtic's Scottish
OL,10,FPremiership title win in May.
OL,12,FTwo police officers were seriously
OL,13,Finjured and three members of the public
OL,14,Frequired hospital treatment when
OL,15,Ftrouble broke out in the Trongate area
OL,16,Fof Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
