OL,3,GNEWSASeven more arrets over Celtic
OL,4,Atitle party disorder - bringing total
OL,5,Ato 50
OL,6,
OL,7,FSix males, aged 17, 18, 33, 35, 43 and
OL,8,F45, and a 28-year-old woman are accused
OL,9,Fof various offences, including assault,
OL,10,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,11,Fculpable and reckless conduct and
OL,12,Fbreach of the peace.
OL,14,FThey will appear at Glasgow Sheriff
OL,15,FCourt at a later date. It brings the
OL,16,Fnumber of arrests around the title
OL,17,Fparty disorder to 50.
